  choices = $EXPL$["The debtor must be a corporation or partnership, not an individual","The debtor must be an individual with regular income and debts below statutory limits","The debtor must have no income or assets at the time of filing","The debtor must have been previously denied a Chapter 7 discharge"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under 11 U.S.C. Section 109(e), Chapter 13 eligibility requires the debtor be an individual with regular income whose noncontingent, liquidated unsecured and secured debts each fall below statutory limits. The debtor must propose a 3-to-5-year repayment plan under Section 1322. Sandra qualifies as an individual with regular income.
